MUSIC AND SOUND
- Score: synthesized with numpy in mix.py (power chords, bass, drums, square-wave lead, the shutter as percussion).
- Foley: synthesized with numpy (mix.py, core/audio/sfx.py helpers): ink brush, paper, shutter, iris, impacts,
  focus beeps, heartbeat, wings, flip book.
